ign context: #1256; `doc/2026-11-01T21-07-00Z_design_pm-stack_forecasting/2026-11-01T21-07-00Z_design_pm-stack_forecasting.md` (§4). Consume the models in #3982 and #3983, and report unsupported values honestly.\n\n## Goal\nExpose one machine-first forecast contract and render the same information in Roadmap and Projects without making a weak estimate look like a commitment.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- A forecast JSON endpoint returns scope/subject, `asOf`, model version, input window/coverage, remaining units, nullable P50/P80 date ranges, confidence, baseline source, and structured reasons/limitations. Quota/stall outputs carry their additional fields from #1256 design.\n- Roadmap and Projects consume the same contract and render ranges with confidence, sample/window and source limitations beside them; no forecast is a bare date.\n- “No measurable pace,” “not enough history,” and “quota rate unavailable” are first-class states; missing values are never rendered as zero or safe.\n- Project/pool scope and GitHub-vs-Project status disagreement remain visible.\n- API and rendering tests cover high/low/unavailable confidence, stale source, missing baseline, and all three forecast types.","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/event